msgctxt "2047\t2152"
msgid "I'm the freaking savior of Okinawa, baby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2153\t2197"
msgid "Wow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2198\t2384"
msgid ""
"The island's future is brighter than ever!\\nEveryone's gonna remember the "
"legend of Toma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2933\t3015"
msgid "Well? Aren't I the best?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3030\t3069"
msgid "Course I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3070\t3178"
msgid "Now come on, bottoms up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3728\t3788"
msgid "Don't do it!"
msgstr "Non farlo!"

msgctxt "3859\t3919"
msgid "Tamiya told me everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3941\t4034"
msgid "Why you shot Nakahara and Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4035\t4169"
msgid "Why you're about to put\\na bullet between Toma eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4187\t4305"
msgid "He's gonna... kill me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380\t4504"
msgid "Tamiya sent me.\\nTo stop you from making this mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4513\t4715"
msgid ""
"I don't care if it came from the top of the CIA.\\nThis can't be what you "
"want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4730\t4790"
msgid "The CIA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4805\t4884"
msgid "Then that means..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4892\t4982"
msgid "Minister Tamiya's gonna have me killed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5272\t5332"
msgid "Not another step."
msgstr "Non un altro passo."

msgctxt "5341\t5401"
msgid "Joji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5410\t5491"
msgid "Are you really going to kill Toma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5535\t5607"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu, yes?"
msgstr "Sei Kazuma Kiryu-san, vero?"

msgctxt "5611\t5715"
msgid "You of all people should know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5722\t5849"
msgid "When your chairman tells you to do something,\\nyou damn well do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5854\t5914"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "5915\t6004"
msgid "And the CIA is my \"chairman.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6005\t6194"
msgid ""
"They say I need to kill someone, no matter\\nthe target... I'm going to kill"
" them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6332\t6426"
msgid "I'll see you in hell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6750\t6810"
msgid "Go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7048\t7109"
msgid "What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7150\t7274"
msgid "I saved Toma... and now it's your turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7299\t7371"
msgid "That's the promise I made Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7390\t7531"
msgid "Tamiya, huh? He was always so naive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7563\t7712"
msgid "You're not killing anyone else.\\nI'm gonna make sure of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7750\t7821"
msgid "I'm merely following orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7849\t7976"
msgid "If you want to stop me...\\nyou know what comes next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8002\t8061"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "8062\t8194"
msgid "There's only one way to solve this.\\nWith our fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8200\t8290"
msgid "I see why my brother took a shine to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8302\t8368"
msgid "You're brighter than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8415\t8507"
msgid "But his blood flows through my veins."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8523\t8608"
msgid "Can you truly fight me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8610\t8670"
msgid "Let's find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8681\t8769"
msgid "Blood isn't what matters, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8771\t8835"
msgid "Me and Kazama-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8845\t8920"
msgid "Our bond was far stronger than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8961\t9095"
msgid "Show me, then.\\nJust how strong it was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9364\t9421"
msgid "Now, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9440\t9500"
msgid "We fight!"
msgstr ""
